  "conclusion": "The exact app write/readback and bounded firmware lifecycle passed safely, and the synchronized microphone capture contained no qualifying 440 Hz event. A post-run cross-revision net audit showed that D2.4 held GPIO30 in the state that shuts down U4 and likely disables the optional NS4168 direct-amplifier path through Q10. The acoustic result is therefore a trustworthy negative for the executed waveform but inconclusive for an enabled direct speaker path. Reusable and Doom audio remain unauthorized pending a fresh bounded GPIO30-low playback test."
